# SDD Protocol — Air Finance App

## 1. Before coding

1. Read docs in `CLAUDE.md` / `AGENTS.md` for the area being modified.
2. Read at least one neighboring file to understand the existing pattern.
3. Search before creating — reuse > recreate.

## 2. TDD (mandatory)

**Cycle: Red → Green → Refactor.** Write the failing test FIRST, then production code.

| Change | TDD | Test target |
|---|---|---|
| Hook / service / utility / bugfix | Required | I/O, edges, errors. Bugfix: reproduce bug first |
| Component (logic) | Required | Hook behavior, conditional rendering |
| Component (visual) / refactor | Recommended | Snapshot or interaction; keep existing tests green |

**Conventions:** colocated `*.test.ts(x)`, `@testing-library/react` for hooks/components, mock `apiClient` for services. Descriptions in English. No `any` in tests.

**Agent workflow:** task → write `*.test.ts` → run tests (must FAIL) → write code (must PASS) → refactor → next unit. **Never skip the test-first step.**

## 3. File placement

| Artifact | Location | Naming |
|---|---|---|
| Page | `apps/web/src/pages/<feature>/index.tsx` | PascalCase |
| Page sub-components | `pages/<feature>/components/` | `<Feature><Part>.tsx` |
| Page hooks | `pages/<feature>/hooks/` | `use<Feature><Action>.ts` |
| Global component | `src/components/` or `components/ui/` | PascalCase |
| Service | `src/services/<feature>Service.ts` | camelCase |
| Hook (global) | `src/hooks/use<Name>.ts` | `use` prefix |
| Store | `src/stores/<name>.ts` | camelCase |
| Type / Util | `src/types/` · `src/utils/` | PascalCase / camelCase |
| Route | `src/routes/` | Lazy import pattern |

## 4. Page structure

```
pages/<feature>/ → index.tsx, components/{Header,Filters,List,Card,EmptyState,ErrorState}, hooks/{Filters,Sorting}
```

Every page: `ViewDefault` (auth) or `LayoutAuth` (public), loading/error/empty states, mobile-first, dark mode, UI primitives from `components/ui/`.

## 5. Data flow

`Route → Page → Hook → Service(apiClient) → TanStack Query → UI ↔ Zustand(UI state only)`

Server state: TanStack Query. Client UI state: Zustand. Forms: react-hook-form + zod. Never mix server state in Zustand.

## 6. TypeScript

No `any`. Use `??` not `||`. Props `readonly`. Prefer `interface`. Export shared types from `types/`.

## 7. Styling

Mobile-first (base → `sm:` → `md:` → `lg:`). Tailwind only. Design system colors (`primary-*`, `text`, `card`, `border`, `background`). Always `dark:` variants. Touch ≥ 44px. Safe area utils for fixed elements.

## 8. Quality gates

`yarn typecheck` + `yarn lint` pass. Mobile 375px OK. Dark mode OK. Loading/error/empty handled. No `any`. No unnecessary comments. Patterns followed.

## 9. Harness

| TypeScript | `yarn typecheck` |
|---|---|
| Lint | `yarn lint` |
| Build | `yarn build` |
| Mobile | DevTools 375px |
| Route | Navigate to changed route |

## 10. Forbidden

No files > 500 lines. No `.env` changes without authorization. No new deps without checking existing. No mock data outside tests. No skipping `ViewDefault`. No desktop-first. No secrets in code.
